    "answer": {
        "text": "§\nAdverse Effects - Unrelated to kidneys (4) : Amphotericin B\n\n(1) Infusion reaction ⇒ Hypotension\n(2) \"Shake and bake\" chills\n\n(3) Seizures\n\n(4) Thrombophlebitis\n\n(Note: Seizures usually due to intrathecal administration)\n\n[Image: aa194760484b485913949f4c0f547e31bda0d102372d40b00c9ed95779681eb1]\n\n[Image: 3c51675ea0dd7a885476d6b99c99612bd1e31e70f27fe70f7d71bfe40dd99e51]\n\n[Image: 6ebfefdf9594e4385709bdb4b325093785826e26fe2dcec94f37250beb0d9650]\n\n[Image: 88a5b77d52c173815c589f46a911b3c8e10e4836f4fab0cdbc2c9533a88021d1]\n\n5.1 - Amphotericin, flucytosine\n[Image: 1b5ef9e80679b88c53a62ff8080f4e3c7f53075f3c49a5f37b120709205d0f02]\n\n[Image: 9fea5bd77323260182de515cbffdde9b432b1f89133f3e2604ac45c707e00d63]\n\n[Image: fb48c171e859420e532b213516a0ea4e3c6c3f280d6874edde07b7bcec252ce5]\n\n[Image: a67623382ecfd97911d2fef4eed826b01e0e668e098272c6a4ea38eded47718d]",
